          %h3#quantum_teleportation Quantum teleportation
          %p
            Also the correction-operation in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+teleportation+protocol"} quantum teleportation protocol
            (“Bob’s operation”) is given by classically-controlled quantum gates.
          %h2#properties Properties
